<title>UK: TENNIS-RAIN WASHES OUT EASTBOURNE FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RAIN WASHES OUT EASTBOURNE FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>EASTBOURNE, England 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain washed out the</p>
<p>final of the Eastbourne women's grasscourt tournament on Sunday</p>
<p>between Arantxa Sanchez Vicario of Spain, and Jana Novotna of</p>
<p>the Czech Republic.</p>
<p>Both girls shared the 48,000 pounds ($79,400) first prize as</p>
<p>tournament officials were forced to abandon the final for the</p>
<p>first time in its 19-year history.</p>
</text>
